    "created_at": "2022-06-10T16:21:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-10T16:21:28Z",
    "body": "This isn't necessary; all IDL attributes are already exported, as the build error shows.\r\n\r\n(Also, in general when sending export PRs, it's best to describe why you want it, so that we know that the referring spec isn't reaching into HTML's internals unnecessarily. E.g., we don't export things for the sake of monkeypatch specs, or specs that will eventually be upstreamed into HTML.)",
